 max-md:leading-[20px]">VIP Fee Tier</span></li><li id="2" class="bu-min-w-[32px] bu-cursor-pointer bu-text-[20px] ltr:bu-mr-[24px] rtl:bu-ml-[24px] bu-transition-colors bu-text-light-label-40 hover:bu-text-light-label" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="radix-:Rkmpi6:-content-2" data-state="inactive" tabindex="-1" data-orientation="horizontal" data-radix-collection-item><span class="text-center text-[20px] font-medium leading-[30px] max-md:text-[14px] max-md:leading-[20px]">Discount &amp; Risk Rates</span></li></ul></div><div class="bu-h-full bu-w-full"><div data-state="active" data-orientation="horizontal" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="radix-:Rkmpi6:-trigger-1" id="radix-:Rkmpi6:-content-1" tabindex="0" class="bu-h-full bu-w-full" style="animation-duration:0s"><div class="flex flex-col gap-6 pt-6 max-md:gap-4"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><p class="bu-text-base bu-font-normal bu-text-light-label text-base leading-[20px] text-light-label-40">BloFin offers different trading fee rates for VIP users. Users can enjoy higher trading fee discounts according to their VIP levels.</p><p class="bu-text-base bu-font-normal bu-text-light-label text-base leading-[20px] text-light-label-40">Users can level up their VIP status to unlock corresponding fee discounts by increasing either their asset balance or trading volume over the past 30 days. VIP levels are updated daily at 1:00 (UTC). Sub-accounts will synchronize their fee rates with the main account. Please refer to the table below for the processing fees for different products and the requirements for each VIP level.</p><p class="bu-text-base bu-font-normal bu-text-light-label text-base leading-[20px] text-light-label-40">If users meet the conditions for different fee tiers in terms of total trading volume of perpetual contracts,  spot trading volume, and total assets, they will enjoy the fee discount of the highest fee tier.</p><p class="bu-text-base bu-font-normal bu-text-light-label text-base leading-[20px] text-light-label-40">For example, if a user’s 30-day total trading volume of perpetual contracts is 68,000,000 USDT (VIP 3) and their 30-day spot trading volume is 28,000,000 USDT (VIP 2), the user will enjoy fee discounts in all markets as a VIP 3 user.</p></div><div class="fees_fee-box__oWBQz"><div class="mb-4 flex gap-4"><button type="button" class="bu-box-border bu-inline-flex bu-items-center bu-justify-center bu-font-medium bu-relative bu-isolate bu-select-none bu-outline-none bu-transition-[background-color,border-color,color,box-shadow,transform,filter] bu-duration-150 bu-ease-out enabled:bu-cursor-pointer enabled:active:bu-translate-y-[1px] enabled:active:bu-scale-[0.98] enabled:active:bu-brightness-95 disabled:bu-cursor-not-allowed focus-visible:bu-ring-2 focus-visible:bu-ring-offset-2 focus-visible:bu-ring-light-primary-40 focus-visible:bu-ring-offset-light-background bu-bg-light-fill-secondary hover:bu-bg-light-hover-fill-secondary hover:bu-text-light-primary bu-text-light-label bu-h-[28px] bu-min-w-[80px] bu-rounded-[var(--btn-rounded-small)] bu-px-[12px] bu-text-[12px] bu-leading-[18px] max-md:hover:bg max-md:hover:text-light-label" data-state="checked">Futures</button><button type="button" class="bu-box-border bu-inline-flex bu-items-center bu-justify-center bu-font-medium bu-relative bu-isolate bu-select-none bu-outline-none bu-transition-[background-color,border-color,color,box-shadow,transform,filter] bu-duration-150 bu-ease-out enabled:bu-cursor-pointer enabled:active:bu-translate-y-[1px] enabled:active:bu-scale-[0.98] enabled:active:bu-brightness-95 disabled:bu-cursor-not-allowed focus-visible:bu-ring-2 focus-visible:bu-ring-offset-2 focus-visible:bu-ring-light-primary-40 focus-visible:bu-ring-offset-light-background bu-text-light-label hover:bu-text-light-primary bu-h-[28px] bu-min-w-[80px] bu-rounded-[var(--btn-rounded-small)] bu-px-[12px] bu-text-[12px] bu-leading-[18px] text-light-label-40" data-state="checked">Spot</button></div><div class="_container_1uzc8_1" style="overflow-y:scroll;height:auto"><div class="_scroll_1uzc8_163"><table class="_table_1uzc8_12" style="width:100%;min-width:100%;table-layout:auto"><thead class="_thead_1uzc8_74 fees_thead-fees__iwS3y"><tr><th class="_th_1uzc8_60 bu-bg-light-background th-drag-item" style="width:100px;text-align:start"><div style="justify-content:flex-start;width:100%"><div style="cursor:default;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-start"><span>Tiers</span></div></div></th><th class="_th_1uzc8_60 bu-bg-light-background th-drag-item" style="width:130px;text-align:start"><div style="justify-content:flex-start;width:100%"><div style="cursor:default;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-start"><span>Maker Fee Rate</span></div></div></th><th class="_th_1uzc8_60 bu-bg-light-background th-drag-item" style="width:130px;text-align:start"><div style="justify-content:flex-start;width:100%"><div style="cursor:default;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-start"><span>Taker Fee Rate</span></div></div></th><th class="_th_1uzc8_60 bu-bg-light-background th-drag-item" style="width:232px;text-align:start"><div style="justify-content:flex-start;width:100%"><div style="cursor:default;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-start"><span>30 days futures trading volume (USDT)</span></div></div></th><th class="_th_1uzc8_60 bu-bg-light-background th-drag-item" style="width:100px;text-align:start"><div style="justify-content:flex-start;width:100%"><div style="cursor:default;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-start"><span>And / Or</span></div></div></th><th class="_th_1uzc8_60 bu-bg-light-background th-drag-item" style="width:232px;text-align:start"><div style="justify-content:flex-start;width:100%"><div style="cursor:default;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-start"><span>30 days spot trading volume (USDT)</span></div></div></th><th class="_th_1uzc8_60 bu-bg-light-background th-drag-item" style="width:100px;text-align:start"><div style="justify-content:flex-start;width:100%"><div style="cursor:default;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-start"><span>And / Or</span></div></div></th><th class="_th_1uzc8_60 bu-bg-light-background th-drag-item" style="width:130px;text-align:start"><div style="justify-content:flex-start;width:100%"><div style="cursor:default;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-start"><span>Assets (USDT)</span></div></div></th></tr></thead><tbody class="fees_tbody-fees___5HKT"><tr id class="_hover_1uzc8_100"><td class="_td_1uzc8_79 bu-bg-light-background" style="width:100px;text-align:start"><div>Regular</div></td><td class="_td_1uzc8_79 bu-bg-light-background" style="width:130px;text-align:start"><div>0.0200%</div></td><td class="_td_1uzc8_79 bu-bg-light-background" style="width:130px;text-align:start"><div>0.0600%</div></td><td class="_td_1uzc8_79 bu-bg-light-background" style="width:232px;text-align:start"><div><div>&lt;<!-- --> <!-- -->10,000,000</div></div></td><td class="_td_1uzc8_79 bu-bg-light-background" style="width:100px;text-align:start"><div>And</div></td><td class="_td_1uzc8_79 bu-bg-light-background" style="width:232px;text-align:start"><div><div>&lt;<!-- --> <!-- -->1,000,000</div></div></td><td class="_td_1uzc8_79 bu-bg-light-background" style="width:100px;text-align:start"><div>And</div></td><td class="_td_1uzc8_79 bu-bg-light-background" style="width:130px;text-align:start"><div>&lt;<!-- --> <!-- -->50,000</div></td></tr><tr id class="_hover_1uzc8_100"><td class="_td_1uzc8_79 bu-bg-light-background" style="width:100px;text-align:start"><div>VIP 1</div></td><td class="_td_1uzc8_79 bu-bg-light-background" style="width:130px;text-align:start"><div>0.0060%</div></td><td class="_td_1uzc8_79 bu-bg-light-background" style="width:130px;text-align:start"><div>0.0500%</div></td><td class="_td_1uzc8_79 bu-bg-light-background" style="width:232px;text-align:start"><div><div>≥<!-- --> <!-- -->10,000,000</div></div></td><td class="_td_1uzc8_79 bu-bg-light-background" style="width:100px;text-align:start"><div>Or</div></td><td class="_td_1uzc8_79 bu-bg-light-background" style="width:232px;text-align:start"><div><div>≥<!-- --> <!-- -->1,000,000</div></div></td><td class="_td_1uzc8_79 bu-bg-light-background" style="width:100px;text-align:start"><div>Or</div></td><td class="_td_1uzc8_79 bu-bg-light-background" style="width:130px;text-align:start"><div>≥<!-- --> <!-- -->50,000</div></td></tr><tr id class="_hover_1uzc8_100"><td class="_td_1uzc8_79 bu-bg-light-background" style="width:100px;text-align:start"><div>VIP 2</div></td><td class="_td_1uzc8_79 bu-bg-light-background" style="width:130px;text-align:start"><div>0.0040%</div></td><td class="_td_1uzc8_79 bu-bg-light-background" style="width:130px;text-align:start"><div>0.0450%</div></td><td class="_td_1uzc8_79 bu-bg-light-background" style="width:232px;text-align:start"><div><div>≥<!-- --> <!-- -->25,000,000</div></div></td><td class="_td_1uzc8_79 bu-bg-light-background" style="width:100px;text-align:start"><div>Or</div></td><td class="_td_1uzc8_79 bu-bg-light-background" style="width:232px;text-align:start"><div><div>≥<!-- --> <!-- -->2,000,000</div></div></td><td class="_td_1uzc8_79 bu-bg-light-background" style="width:100px;text-align:start"><div>Or</div></td><td class="_td_1uzc8_79 bu-bg-light-background" style="width:130px;text-align:start"><div>≥<!-- --> <!-- -->500,000</div></td></tr><tr id class="_hover_1uzc8_100"><td class="_td_1uzc8_79 bu-bg-light-background" style="width:100px;text-align:start"><div>VIP 3</div></td><td class="_td_1uzc8_79 bu-bg-light-background" style="width:130px;text-align:start"><div>0.0020%</div></td><td class="_td_1uzc8_79 bu-bg-light-background" style="width:130px;text-align:start"><div>0.0425%</div></td><td class="_td_1uzc8_79 bu-bg-light-background" style="width:232px;text-align:start"><div><div>≥<!-- --> <!-- -->50,000,000</div></div></td><td class="_td_1uzc8_79 bu-bg-light-background" style="width:100px;text-align:start"><div>Or</div></td><td class="_td_1uzc8_79 bu-bg-light-background" style="width:232px;text-align:start"><div><div>≥<!-- --> <!-- -->4,000,000</div></div></td><td class="_td_1uzc8_79 bu-bg-light-background" style="width:100px;text-align:start"><div>Or</div></td><td class="_td_1uzc8_79 bu-bg-light-background" style="width:130px;text-align:start"><div>≥<!-- --> <!-- -->1,000,000</div></td></tr><tr id class="_hover_1uzc8_100"><td class="_td_1uzc8_79 bu-bg-light-background" style="width:100px;text-align:start"><div>VIP 4</div></td><td class="_td_1uzc8_79 bu-bg-light-background" style="width:130px;text-align:start"><div>0.0010%</div></td><td class="_td_1uzc8_79 bu-bg-light-background" style="width:130px;text-align:start"><div>0.0400%</div></td><td class="_td_1uzc8_79 bu-bg-light-background" style="width:232px;text-align:start"><div><div>≥<!-- --> <!-- -->200,000,000</div><div class="pl-[8px]">(<!-- -->Non-API Trading<!-- --> ≥<!-- --> <!-- -->160,000,000<!-- -->)</div></div></td><td class="_td_1uzc8_79 bu-bg-light-background" style="width:100px;text-align:start"><div>Or</div></td><td class="_td_1uzc8_79 bu-bg-light-background" style="width:232px;text-align:start"><div><div>≥<!-- --> <!-- -->6,000,000</div><div>(<!-- -->Non-API Trading<!-- --> ≥<!-- --> <!-- -->4,800,000<!-- -->)</div></div></td><td class="_td_1uzc8_79 bu-bg-light-background" style="width:100px;text-align:start"><div>Or</div></td><td class="_td_1uzc8_79 bu-bg-light-background" style="width:130px;text-align:start"><div>≥<!-- --> <!-- -->2,000,000</div></td></tr><tr id class="_hover_1uzc8_100"><td class="_td_1uzc8_79 bu-bg-light-background" style="width:100px;text-align:start"><div>VIP 5</div></td><td class="_td_1uzc8_79 bu-bg-light-background" style="width:130px;text-align:start"><div>0.0000%</div></td><td class="_td_1uzc8_79 bu-bg-light-background" style="width:130px;text-align:start"><div>0.0350%</div></td><td class="_td_1uzc8_79 bu-bg-light-background" style="width:232px;text-align:start"><div><div>≥<!-- --> <!-- -->500,000,000</div><div class="pl-[8px]">(<!-- -->Non-API Trading<!-- --> ≥<!-- --> <!-- -->400,000,000<!-- -->)</div></div></td><td class="_td_1uzc8_79 bu-bg-light-background" style="width:100px;text-align:start"><div>Or</div></td><td class="_td_1uzc8_79 bu-bg-light-background" style="width:232px;text-align:start"><div><div>≥<!-- --> <!-- -->8,000,000</div><div>(<!-- -->Non-API Trading<!-- --> ≥<!-- --> <!-- -->6,400,000<!-- -->)</div></div></td><td class="_td_1uzc8_79 bu-bg-light-background" style="width:100px;text-align:start"><div>Or</div></td><td class="_td_1uzc8_79 bu-bg-light-background" style="width:130px;text-align:start"><div>≥<!-- --> <!-- -->3,000,000</div></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><p class="bu-text-lg bu-font-medium bu-text-light-label leading-[26px] text-light-label">30-day Trading Volume (USDT)</p><p class="bu-text-base bu-font-normal bu-text-light-label text-base leading-[20px] text-light-label-40">BloFin will calculate the total 30-day volume of all your futures trades and spot trades, and reset it at 00:00 (UTC) everyday.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><p class="bu-text-lg bu-font-medium bu-text-light-label leading-[26px] text-light-label">Total Assets</p><p class="bu-text-base bu-font-normal bu-text-light-label text-base leading-[20px] text-light-label-40">BloFin will take a snapshot of users&#x27; crypto assets at 00:00 (UTC) every day, covering the balance of the Funding Account and Trading Account, with Futures Bonus and Vouchers excluded.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><p class="bu-text-lg bu-font-medium bu-text-light-label leading-[26px] text-light-label">Makers and Takers</p><p class="bu-text-base bu-font-normal bu-text-light-label text-base leading-[20px] text-light-label-40">A maker order is a limit order that goes into the order book before being filled. For example, if the current lowest ask price for BTC is 1,000 USDT and you create a maker order with a bid price of 999 USDT, this order will not be filled immediately. It will then enter the order book until someone fills it. Once filled, you are required to pay the maker fee, and the taker will pay the taker fee. You also need to pay the taker fee when your limit ask order is filled.</p></div></div></div><div data-state="inactive" data-orientation="horizontal" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="radix-:Rkmpi6:-trigger-2" hidden id="radix-:Rkmpi6:-content-2" tabindex="0" class="bu-h-full bu-w-full"></div></div></div></div></main><div class="blofin-nav-footer" id="footer"><footer class="py-[16px] bg-light-background !px-0 !pl-[24px]"><div class="w-full max-w-screen-xl px-0 flex items-center"><div class="flex items-center justify-start"><li class="leading-5"><p class="text-[12px] leading-[18px] text-light-label"><a href="/en/data/information/BTC-USDT" class="flex items-center">Market Data</a></p></li><div class="h-[12px] w-[1px] mx-[8px] bg-light-line-primary"></div></div><div class="flex items-center justify-start"><li class="leading-5"><p class="text-[12px] leading-[18px] text-light-label"><a href="/en/fees" class="flex items-center">Fee Schedule</a></p></li><div class="h-[12px] w-[1px] mx-[8px] bg-light-line-primary"></div></div><div class="flex items-center justify-start"><li class="leading-5"><p class="text-[12px] leading-[18px] text-light-label"><a href="/en/apis" class="flex items-center">APIs</a></p></li><div class="h-[12px] w-[1px] mx-[8px] bg-light-line-primary"></div></div><div class="flex items-center justify-start"><li class="leading-5"><p class="text-[12px] leading-[18px] text-light-label"><a href="/en/support" class="flex items-center">Support Center</a></p></li></div><div class="ml-[48px] text-sm leading-[18px] text-light-label-40">© 2026 BloFin. All rights reserved.</div></div></footer></div></div><script id="__NEXT_DATA__" type="application/json">{"props":{"pageProps":{"messages":{"components"