ocation where BloFin is unable to provide services. We apologize for any inconvenience this may cause. For more information regarding the Restricted Locations, please refer to \u003ccolor\u003ethe User Agreement\u003c/color\u003e. Should you have any other questions, please contact our Customer Support Team.","acknowledge":"I Acknowledge","later":"Later","unavailable":"Unavailable","activityRiskTip":"This event is unavailable to you at the moment","goToFutures":"Go to Futures","notEligible":"Not Eligible","notEligibleForEvent":"You're not eligible for this event. Keep trading Futures to unlock more opportunities on BloFin.","tradeNow":"Trade Now","exploreMoreEvents":"Explore More Events","earnFlexible":"Earn-Flexible Assets","selectAccount":"Select Account","accountsTips":"You can use available balances across multiple accounts in one transaction. Funds are deducted in your predefined priority order.","transferEarnFlexible":"Transfers into Earn-Flexible Assets count as subscriptions; transfers out count as redemptions.","transferRewardRiskWarning":"This transfer may make you ineligible for the Reward Hub deposit task reward.","transferAmountMustBeNumeric":"The amount must be numeric","transferAmountExceedsAvailableBalance":"Transfer amount exceeds available balance."},"copy-trade":{"settings":"Settings","contracts":"Contracts","tpOrSlIntroduce":"One-triggers-the-other order(\u003clink\u003eOTO\u003c/link\u003e)allows you to place a primary order and a secondary order at the same time.","exceedMaxPrice":"The price can not be higher than 100,000,000 USDT","tpslProfitDescription":"When the price reaches {triggerPrice} {quote} , it will trigger a {orderType} order, and the estimated PnL will be \u003ccolor\u003e{profit} {quote}\u003c/color\u003e","close":"Close","tpslPositionDescription":"When the price reaches \u003ctrigger\u003e\u003c/trigger\u003e, it will trigger a \u003corderType\u003e\u003c/orderType\u003e order.","tpslOrderProfitDes":"When the price reaches \u003ctrigger\u003e\u003c/trigger\u003e, it will trigger a \u003corderType\u003e\u003c/orderType\u003e order, and the estimated PnL will be \u003ccolor\u003e\u003c/color\u003e.","closingPrt":"Closing Prioritization","fixedRatio":"Fixed Ratio","pnl":"PnL","position":"Entire Position","partial":"Partial Position","orders":"Orders","orderId":"Order ID","estClose":"Est. Close ({unitName})","estPnl":"Est. PnL ({quoteCurrency})","estTotalPnl":"Est. Total PnL","minRatio":"Please enter a positive integer between 1 and 100.","closingRatioTip":"In this mode, your trades will be closed in proportion to your position. For example, if a trader has a 1 BTC position with two trades of 0.2 BTC and 0.8 BTC, when the trader partially closes 20% of his position (0.2 BTC), the two trades will be closed with amounts of 0.04 BTC and 0.16 BTC respectively. Copiers' positions will also be closed in the same proportion.","closingPnlTip":"In this mode, your trades will be closed based on their PnL% in ascending order. For instance, if a trader has a 1 BTC position with two trades of 0.2 BTC (PnL%: 52%) and 0.8 BTC (PnL%: -20%), when the trader partially closes 20% of their position (0.2 BTC), the two trades will be closed with amounts of 0.2 BTC and 0 BTC respectively. Copiers' positions will also be closed in the same proportion.","closingNoteTip-1":"Please note","closingNoteTip-2":"If the order size is below the minimum order amount, the system will not execute the order for both traders and copiers.","closingNoteTip-3":"The order and position's PnL are based on different entry prices. Therefore, there is a variation between the actual change in available balance and the realized PnL of your orders when you partially close the position.","closeOrderTip":"In this part, the estimated closing amount and PnL will be shown when you place a close order or when your TP/SL order is triggered. The estimated PnL is calculated based on the order price (trigger price) and the average price of your position. The estimated PnL does not include the close trading fee. Actual PnL may vary.","amountTip1":"The order quantity remains the same regardless of the position size.","amountTip2":"The order quantity for TP/SL matches the position amount when TP/SL triggers. It adjusts according to the position size.","adjustBalance":"Adjust Balance","addBalanceTip":"Add assets to your ongoing copy from your Futures account","removeBalanceTip":"Remove assets from the Copy Trading account, and the removed assets will go back to your Futures Account.","addBalanceTipWithType":"Add assets to your ongoing copy trade from your {type}.","unified":"UTA","funding":"Funding","spot":"Spot","removeBalanceTipWithType":"Remove assets from the Copy Trading account, and the removed assets will go back to your {type}.","balanceAmount":"Amount","available":"Available","futures":"Futures","max":"Max","maxAmountAdd":"Max. Amount to Add","maxAmountRmove":"Max. Amount to Remove","submit":"Submit","add":"Add","remove":"Remove","copyTradingRemoveWarn":"Any transfer out from the Copy Trading Account will cause the Copy Trading Bonus to be immediately reclaimed.","copyTradingAddWarn":"Any transfer out from the {type} Account will cause the {type} bonus to be immediately reclaimed.","copyTradingSecondConfirm":"{amount} {account} Bonus will be reclaimed. Do you confirm the assets transfer anyway?"},"amend-order":{"lastPrice":"Last Price","markPrice":"Mark Price","price":"Price","amount":"Amount","takeProfit":"Take Profit","stopLoss":"Stop Loss","tpTriggerPrice":"Trigger Price","tpOrderPrice":"TP order price","tpslProfitDescription":"When the price reaches {triggerPrice} {quote} , it will trigger a {orderType} order, and the estimated PnL will be \u003ccolor\u003e{profit} {quote}\u003c/color\u003e","slOrderPrice":"SL order price","slTriggerPrice":"SL trigger price","cross":"Cross","isolated":"Isolated","buy":"Buy","sell":"Sell","prep":"Perp","market":"Market","amendOrder":"Modify Order","last":"Last","cont":"Cont","positions":"Positions","open_long":"Open Long","open_short":"Open Short","close_long":"Close Long","close_short":"Close Short","tpslProfitDescription2":"When the price reaches {triggerPrice} {quote1} , it will trigger a {orderType} order, and the estimated PnL will be \u003ccolor\u003e{profit} {quote2}\u003c/color\u003e"},"cancel-order":{"cancelOrderTip":"Partially filled order could not be followed by copiers, are you sure to cancel?","cancel":"Cancel","confirm":"Confirm","amendOrder":"Modify Order","last":"Last"},"account":{"basic":"Basic","advanced":"Advanced","switchMode":"Switch Mode","accountMode":"Account Mode","accountModeSPOT":"Spot mode","accountModeSPOTFUTURES":"Spot and futures mode","accountModeCROSSCOIN":"Multi-currency margin mode","selectAccountMode":"Select account mode","descSpot":"For spot traders.","labelSpot":"Spot","labelPerpetual":"Perpetual","marginMode":"Margin mode","marginCross":"Cross","marginIsolated":"Isolated","useofFunds":"Use of funds","useofFundsSpot":"Trade with the available balance in your trading account.","riskAssessment":"Risk assessment","riskAssessmentSpot":"Spot mode has no liquidation risks.","showLess":"Show less","showMore":"Show more","descSpotFutures":"For spot and futures traders.","useofFundsSpotFutures":"Symbols with the same margin crypto share the margin. Profit and loss for cross positions can be offset. Floating profits can be used to open new positions","riskAssessmentSpotFutures":"Cross positions that use the same crypto as margin share the risk. Should liquidation occur, only cross positions using the same margin crypto will be affected.","descCrossCoin":"For professional traders. Crypto assets are valued in USD when margin is calculated.","useofFundsCrossCoin":"All crypto that can be used as a margin will be valued in USD for margin calculations. Profit and loss for cross positions can be offset. Floating profits can be used to open new positions.","riskAssessmentCrossCoin":"Cross positions using the same or different crypto as margin share the risk, thereby reducing the overall liquidation risk. Should liquidation occur, all assets in your trading account could be affected.","switchSuccess":"Switched Successfully","switchFail":"Failed to switch account mode","switchSuccessTo":"Account mode changed to \u003ct1\u003e{accountMode}\u003c/t1\u003e successfully","switchFailReason1":"\u003ct1\u003e{limitNumber}\u003c/t1\u003e USDT assets in trading account requirements are not met","switchFailReason2":"Setting failed. Cancel any open orders, close positions, and stop trading bots first","switchFailReason3":"Negative assets in your trading account.","upgradeTitle":"Upgrade to Unified Trading Account","upgradeLinkTitle":"Unified Trading Account User Guide","previous":"Previous","next":"Next","upgrade":"Upgrade","confirm":"Confirm","introduction":"Introduction","thingsToNote":"Things to Note","confirmUpgrade":"Confirm Upgrade","introductionDesc":"One account for spot and derivatives trading","in1Title":"Improved Capital Efficiency","in1Desc":"Offset profits and losses across your Spot assets and Derivatives.","in2Title":"Easier Trading","in2Desc":"Access your full trading capital for both Spot and Derivatives trading, without having to deal with multiple accounts.","in3Title":"Easy Upgrade","in3Desc":"Migration to a Unified Trading Account is a simple process, and your existing data and trading settings stay the same.","accountDesc":"Three account modes designed for different users","ac1Title":"Spot mode","ac1Desc":"Trading Spot without margin risk. Futures trading is not available in this mode.","ac2Title":"Spot and Futures mode (Default)","ac2Desc":"Cross-margin positions in the same crypto share a common margin balance. It’s the default mode after the unified trading account is upgraded.","ac3Title":"Multi-currencies margin mode","ac3Desc":"The USD value of your assets is used to calculate the margin for placing orders and holding positions.","thingsToNoteDesc":"Before s