ted-time offer!","userComebackCancelBtnText":"Maybe later","userComebackConfirmBtnText":"Show Me","xtocksTitle":"About xStocks tokens/the Products","xtocksDes":"BloFin is not the issuer of any xStocks tokens, and consequently assumes no responsibility for any losses (however arising) caused by transactions related to xStocks tokens. By using this service, you hereby acknowledge the relevant risks and agree to bear the trading risks on your own, and further acknowledge, represent and warrant that the statements set forth below are true and correct as of the date hereof:","xtocksContent1":"You are not a US Person as defined under the Securities Act of 1933.","xtocksContent2":"You are not domiciled in a Restricted Location provided under BloFin’s Terms of Use.","xtocksContent3":"You are not a United Kingdom Person (including Northern Ireland), including but not limited to British Nationals and all bodies incorporated or constituted under the law or any part of the United Kingdom.","xtocksContent4":"You are not purchasing xStocks tokens for the account or benefit of a US Person, Restricted Location, or United Kingdom Person.","xtocksContent5":"You were not a US Person, Restricted Location, or United Kingdom Person when the xStocks tokens were offered to you.","xtocksContent6":"You, including any authorized director, employee, signatory, or representative who placed the buy order, are outside of the US, Restricted Location, or the United Kingdom at the time the buy order was originated.","xtocksContent7":"You are eligible to participate in the xStocks token offering, whether as a professional, sophisticated, or accredited investor or otherwise, as may be required under the laws of the jurisdiction in which you are located or other laws applicable to you.","xtocksContent8":"You possess the requisite experience, knowledge, and expertise in financial and business matters to be capable of evaluating the merits, risks, and suitability of participating in transactions of xStocks tokens.","xtocksContent9":"You have not entered into, and are not purchasing the xStocks tokens with a view to entering into any agreement or arrangement for or in connection with the resale or transfer of the xStocks tokens, under which the economic benefits and risks of the xStocks tokens would pass to such person.","xtocksFotter":"Notwithstanding the above, you shall not transfer any xStocks tokens at any such time if the transfer will result in a violation of any applicable laws.","aggrement":"I have fully read, understand and accept the above and the xStocks Risk Disclosure Statement at \u003ccolor\u003eBloFin xStock Risk Statement\u003c/color\u003e","stockFuturesAlertTitle":"Stock Perps - General Disclaimer","stockFuturesHeader1Desc":"BloFin does not issue, sponsor, or endorse any underlying equity securities referenced by the Stock Perpetual Contracts (\"Stock Perps\") and does not represent or warrant any ownership, voting rights, dividends, or other rights associated with the underlying securities. Stock Perps do not constitute the purchase or sale of any actual shares.","stockFuturesHeader2Desc":"By accessing or trading Stock Perps, you acknowledge, understand, and agree that:","stockFuturesRule1":"You are not a \"U.S. Person\" as defined under the U.S. Securities Act of 1933, the U.S. Commodity Exchange Act, or any applicable U.S. federal or state laws.","stockFuturesRule2":"You are not located, domiciled, or ordinarily resident in the United States or any other Restricted Jurisdictions under BloFin’s Terms of Use at the time of placing any order.","stockFuturesRule3":"You are not trading for the account or benefit of any U.S. Person or any person located in a Restriction Jurisdiction.","stockFuturesRule4":"You are not an individual or entity formed, incorporated, or otherwise organized under the laws of the United States, nor acting on behalf of such person or entity.","stockFuturesRule5":"You, and any authorized representative placing orders on your behalf, were physically located outside the United States and any Restricted Jurisdictions at the time the order was initiated.","stockFuturesRule6":"You acknowledge that Stock Perps may be considered derivatives, swaps, or similar instruments under the laws of certain jurisdictions and may be prohibited, restricted, or unregulated in your jurisdiction.","stockFuturesRule7":"You confirm that you are eligible to participate in trading Stock Perps under the laws and regulations applicable to you, whether as a professional, sophisticated, or otherwise qualified investor.","stockFuturesRule8":"You possess the requisite experience, knowledge, and financial sophistication to evaluate the merits, risks, and suitability of trading leveraged derivative products, including the risk of rapid and total loss of your margin.","stockFuturesRule9":"You are not entering into Stock Perps with a view to resale, redistribution, or transfer to any person in violation of applicable laws, including U.S. securities or commodities laws.","stockFuturesBottom1Desc":"Notwithstanding the above, you agree that you shall not transfer, assign, or otherwise make available any Stock Perps, or any economic exposure thereto, if such action would result in a violation of any applicable law or regulation.","stockFuturesBottom2Desc":"BloFin does not provide investment advice, does not make any recommendation regarding the suitability of Stock Perps, and assumes no responsibility for any losses arising from trading these products. You trade solely at your own risk.","stockFuturesAgreeDesc":"I have read, understood, and agree to the above.","stockFuturesNotification":"Outside the primary market’s regular trading hours, the underlying asset may experience limited price movement and reduced liquidity, and order placement may be restricted to reduce-only orders for position closure.","stockPerpsAttestationTitle":"Attestation","stockPerpsAttestationIntro":"By using the Services provided herein, you hereby acknowledge the relevant risks and agree to bear the trading risks on your own, and further acknowledge, represent and warrant that the statements set forth below are true and correct as of the date hereof:","stockPerpsAttestationNonSanctionedTitle":"Non-Sanctioned Status:","stockPerpsAttestationNonSanctionedDesc":"I confirm that I am not, and am not acting on behalf of, any individual or entity listed on any applicable sanctions list maintained by the United Nations Security Council, the U.S. Office of Foreign Assets Control (OFAC), the U.S. Department of State, the European Union, His Majesty’s Treasury (HMT), or any other applicable governmental or regulatory authority, and that no funds associated with my use of the Services are derived from or intended to benefit any sanctioned person or entity.","stockPerpsAttestationGeoComplianceTitle":"Geographic Compliance:","stockPerpsAttestationGeoComplianceDesc":"I confirm that I am not accessing the Services from any country, region, or territory under (a) Restricted Jurisdictions under the Terms of Use; and (b) comprehensive sanctions or trade embargoes. I am not using any VPN, proxy, or other means to circumvent or disguise my true geographic location.","stockPerpsAttestationLegalAuthTitle":"Legal Authorization:","stockPerpsAttestationLegalAuthDesc":"I confirm that my access to and use of the Services complies with all applicable laws and regulations in my jurisdiction, and that I have the full legal capacity and authority to be bound by these terms.","stockPerpsAttestationTradingTitle":"Trading:","stockPerpsAttestationTradingDesc":"I understand and confirm that the Service does not represent or warrant any ownership, voting rights, dividends, or other rights associated with the Perpetual Contracts.","stockPerpsAttestationAgree":"I have read, understood, acknowledged and agree to the above.","gotIt":"Got it","nickNameRule1":"Nickname can only be modified once per day.","nickNameRule2":"3 to 20 characters","deleteChanges":"Delete Changes?","deleteChangesDesc":"If you continue, you will lose any changes you’ve made.","delete":"Delete","usdt":"USDT","usdc":"USDC","maxReduce":"Max. Reducible Amount {amt} {currency}","demoAddMulTip":"You can add {currencies} all at once","demoReduceMulTip":"You can reduce {currencies} all at once","adjustFunds":"Adjust Funds","assetsUnreal":"Asset changes may not update in real time. Please refresh the page before making adjustments.","emailVerification":"Email Verification \u003cstyle\u003e{item}\u003c/style\u003e","smsVerification":"SMS Verification \u003cstyle\u003e{item}\u003c/style\u003e","copy":"Copy","earn_flexible":"Earn-Flexible Assets","transferProcess":"Your transfer is being processed. Please wait.","enableNotificationTip":"Please enable browser notifications for the latest news and rewards","marginMode":"Margin Mode","day":"Day","dptTo":"Deposit To","depositToTooltip":"Your funds will be automatically credited to your selected account after deposit.","depositToTooltip1":"· Funds are credited to your selected account after deposit.","depositToTooltip2":"· Account changes post-deposit will redirect funds accordingly. ","depositToTooltip3":"· Unsupported assets default to your Funding Account.","unified":"UTA","never":"Never","transferEarnFlexible":"Transfers into Earn-Flexible Assets count as subscriptions; transfers out count as redemptions.","depositReminderTitle":"Deposit now to gain Max. {amount} {currency}!","depositReminderSubtitle":"Deposit {amount} USDT within 7 days and hold for 3 days","tierBasic":"Basic Rewards","tierAdvanced":"Advanced Rewards","tierPremium":"Premium Rewards","depositNow":"Deposit Now","noResults":"No Results Found.","basic":"Basic","advanced":"Advanced","premium":"Premium","preIpoRiskTitle":"About Pre-IPO tokens/the Products","preIpoRiskParagraph1":"BloFin is committed to regulatory compliance and operates in accordance with applicable requirements. Please ensure that your use of the platform complies with the laws and regulations in your country or region.","preIpoRiskDisclaimer":"Disclaimer: Pre-IPO Tokens available on BloFin are made available and provided through a seamless integration with a third-party service provider, Realta. Assets listed under “Pre-IPO” do not represent actual ownership of the underlying stocks, and holding these assets does not entitle you to any dividends, interest, voting rights, shareholder privileges, or rights offerings. The underlying Pre-IPO projects are also NOT guaranteed to undergo an initial public offering in any jurisdiction. The Pre-IPO tokens are intended for speculative trading purposes only. Trading these assets involves risks, including market risks, liquidity, pricing mechanisms, or issuer adjustments. Please conduct your own research and carefully assess your risk tolerance before. Past performance is not indicative of future results. Products are not available in certain jurisdictions, and users are solely responsible for ensuring their use of this product complies with local laws and regulations. For further information, please refer to Realta’s official website. Please carefully review the Realta’s Terms of Use and always do your own research.","preIpoRiskIntro":"By using the Services, you hereby acknowledge the relevant risks and agree to bear the trading risks on your own, and further acknowledge, represent and warrant that the statements set forth below are true and correct as of the date hereof:","preIpoRiskItem1":"You are not a US Person as defined under the Securities Act of 1933;","preIpoRiskItem2":"You are not domiciled in a Prohibited Jurisdiction provided under BloFin’s Terms of Service;","preIpoRiskItem3":"You are not purchasing the Pre-IPO Tokens for the account or benefit of a US Person or persons in Prohibited Jurisdiction;","preIpoRiskItem4":"You were not a US Person or persons in Prohibited Jurisdiction when the Tokens were offered to you;","preIpoRiskItem5":"You, including any authorized director, employee, signatory or representative who placed the buy order are outside of the US or Prohibited Jurisdiction at the time the buy order was originated;","preIpoRiskItem6":"You are eligible to participate in the Pre-IPO Tokens offering, whether as a professional, sophisticated or accredited investor, qualified purchaser, or otherwise, as may be required under the laws of the jurisdiction in which you are located or other laws applicable to you;","preIpoRiskItem7":"You possess the requisite experience, knowledge and expertise in financial and business matters to be capable of evaluating the merits, risks and suitability of participating in transactions of Digital Assets;","preIpoRiskItem8":"You understand and acknowledge that BloFin is not registered as, nor purports to act as, a broker-dealer, exchange operator, transfer agent, custodian, or similar regulated entity in any jurisdiction;","preIpoRiskItem9":"You understand that the Pre-IPO Tokens are experimental and provided on an “as is” basis, and issues with the Services or third-party integration could result in loss of funds; all blockchain transactions are final, irreversible, and non-refundable;","preIpoRiskItem10":"You understand that Pre-IPO Tokens provide only economic exposure to private companies; confer no ownership, voting, dividend, information, or other legal rights;","preIpoRiskItem11":"You have conducted your own research and understand that the Pre-IPO Tokens are bearer of digital assets with no ownership, voting, dividend or information rights; are not affiliated with, endorsed by, or issued by referenced companies; and that administrative controls are in place as needed for legal, security, or operational purposes;","preIpoRiskItem12":"You understand that acquiring the Pre-IPO Tokens involves significant risk; Pre-IPO Tokens may have no value; profits are not guaranteed; past performance is not indicative of future results; forward-looking statements are uncertain; and secondary-market liquidity is not guaranteed;","preIpoRiskItem13":"You understand that any redemption of Pre-IPO Tokens, if accepted, is subject to commercially reasonable efforts to realise liquid value and market availability;","preIpoRiskItem14":"You have not entered into, and are not purchasing the Pre-IPO Tokens with the view of entering into any agreement or arrangement for or in connection with the resale or transfer of the Pre-IPO Tokens, under which the economic benefits and risks of the Pre-IPO Tokens would pass on to such person;","preIpoRiskItem15":"You acknowledge that all information provided or referenced on the Website is for information purposes only and shall not be construed or relied upon as legal, financial, tax, accounting, investment, or any other professional advice; is not a recommendation or solicitation to buy or sell securities or to engage with the Pre-IPO Tokens; is not guaranteed to be accurate, complete, or useful; is used at your own risk; may change without notice; and you are responsible for obtaining current information and performing your own due diligence before each use of the Services.","preIpoRiskClosing":"Notwithstanding the above, you shall not transfer any Pre-IPO Tokens at any such time if the transfer will result in a violation of any applicable laws. You shall not transfer or attempt to transfer any Pre-IPO Tokens to a US Person or persons in Restricted Jurisdiction.","preIpoRiskAggrement":"I have read, understand, and accept the above and the \u003clink\u003eBloFin Pre-IPO Risk Disclosure Statement\u003c/link\u003e. I confirm that I am eligible to participate in the Services.","preIpoNotification":"Pre-IPO Tokens do not confer ownership and carry significant risks.","preIpoMarketOrderRiskNotice":"Market orders may be impacted by wide spreads and low liquidity. Trade with caution.","moreDetails":"More Details","rewardsHubStageTransitionWelcomeGiftUnlockedTitle":"Your Welcome Gifts Are Unlocked!","rewardsHubStageTransitionWelcomeGiftUnlockedDesc":"Keep it going — join the 14-Day Challenge for even more rewards.","rewardsHubStageTransitionWelcomeGiftUnlockedCta":"Claim My Rewards","rewardsHubStageTransitionWelcomeGiftMissedTitle":"Don't Miss Out Again","rewardsHubStageTransitionWelcomeGiftMissedDesc":"Your 14-Day New User Challenge is halfway through. Complete it before it's gone!","rewardsHubStageTransitionWelcomeGiftMissedCta":"Continue Now","rewardsHubStageTransitionNewUserTasksUnlockedTitle":"Pro Mode Unlocked","rewardsHubStageTransitionNewUserTasksUnlockedDesc":"You've claimed all New User Exclusive Rewards. More rewards are waiting in Pro!","rewardsHubStageTransitionNewUserTasksUnlockedCta":"Explore Now","rewardsHubStageTransitionNewUserTasksMissedTitle":"Pro Mode Unlocked","rewardsHubStageTransitionNewUserTasksMissedDesc":"New User Exclusive Rewards have ended. More rewards are waiting in Pro!","rewardsHubStageTransitionNewUserTasksMissedCta":"Explore Now","joinNow":"Join Now","addFunds":"Add Funds","addFundsTransferDesc":"Transfer assets among different accounts","addFundsDepositDesc":"Send crypto to your BloFin deposit address","addFundsBuyCryptoDesc":"Buy crypto easily via bank transfer, card and more","soundAlerts":"Sound Alerts","beep":"Beep","checkout":"Checkout","chime":"Chime","glide":"Glide","note":"Note","signal":"Signal","successfully":"Successful","closePrice":"Close Price","marketPrice":"Market Price","estClosingProfit":"Est. Closing Profit","estClosingFee":"Est. Closing Fee","avgPrice":"Avg. Price","closeAllPositionWarning":"Any pending reduce-only orders (limit, TP/SL, trailing stop, or TWAP) will be cancelled upon confirmation.","delistingBannerText":"This trading pair will be delisted on {delistTime}, please be aware of the potential risks when trading","disclaimer":"Disclaimer","disclaimerText1":"This content is provided for general informational purposes only and may include information relating to products or services that are not available in your region. It is not intended to provide (i) investment advice or an investment recommendation; (ii) an offer or solicitation to buy, sell or hold any crypto/digital asset; or (iii) financial, accounting, legal or tax advice. Crypto/digital assets, including stablecoins, involve a high degree of risk and may fluctuate significantly in value. You should carefully consider whether trading or holding crypto/digital assets is suitable for you in light of your financial condition and risk tolerance, and seek independent professional advice where appropriate. Information contained in this content, including market data and statistical information, if any, is provided for general information purposes only. While reasonable care may be taken in presenting such information, BloFin does not guarantee its accuracy, completeness or timeliness and accepts no responsibility or liability for any errors, omissions or inaccuracies.","disclaimerText2":"You are solely responsible for your own trading and investment decisions and any resulting gains or losses arising from reliance on this content. Digital assets are subject to volatility and are not insured. Not financial or investment advice. Not all products and services are available in all regions. Restrictions and T\u0026Cs apply.","dataUpdatedOn":"Data updated on {time}","justNow":"Just now","minutesAgo":"{count} minutes ago","hoursAgo":"{count} hours ago","daysAgo":"{count} days ago","minuteAgo":"1 minute ago","hourAgo":"1 hour ago","dayAgo":"1 day ago"},"sideMenu":{"accountAndSecurity":"Account \u0026 Security","identification":"Identification","myCoupons":"My Rewards","aPis":"APIs","contractInformation":"Contract Information","positionTiers":"Position Tiers","forcedLiquidation":"Forced liquidation","insuranceFund":"Insurance fund","fundingRate":"Funding Rate","parameterAdjustments":"Parameter Adjustments","overview":"Overview","funding":"Funding","spot":"Spot","derivatives":"Futures","copyTrading":"Copy Trading","history":"History","orderCenter":"Order Center","fee":"Fee","earn":"Earn","openinterest":"Open interest","audits":"Audits","analysis":"Account Analysis","myTradingFees":"My Trading Fees","tradingFees":"Trading Fees","trading":"Trading","subAccount":"Sub-account","unifiedTrading":"Unified Trading","thirdPartyAuth":"Third-Party Auth","settings":"Settings"},"fees":{"spot":"Spot","futures":"Futures","mainTitle":"Fee Schedule","introduce-1":"BloFin provides different trading fee rates for different VIP levels. Users can enjoy higher trading fee discounts accounting to different VIP levels.","introduce-2":"Users can increase their VIP level to unlock the corresponding VIP level fee discount by increasing either asset balance or trading volume in the past 30 days. If users meet the conditions of different fee tiers in terms of spot trading volume, total trading volume of perpetual futures, and total assets, they will enjoy the fee discount of the highest fee tier. The VIP level will be updated every morning at 8:00 (UTC). Please refer to the table below for the processing fees for different products and the requirements for each VIP level.","forExample":"For example: Tom's asset balance is 50,000 USDT (VIP 1 standard), spot trading volume in the last 30 days has reached 50,000,000 USDT (VIP 3 standard), and futures trading volume in the last 30 days has reached 25,000,000 USDT (VIP 2 standard). Tom will be upgraded to VIP 3. His trading fees will change correspondently to the VIP 3 rate.","tradingVolume":"30-day Trading Volume (USDT)","tradingVolumeDes":"We calculate the total 30-day volume of all your futures trades and spot trades. The calculation is reset at 16:00 (UTC) everyday.","totalAssets":"Total Assets","totalAssetsDes":"Everyday, we take a snapshot of users' crypto assets at 16:00 (UTC). Snapshot covers the balance of all your assets, including Funding Account, Futures Account, Spot Account, Copy Trading Account, and Earn Account. Trail funds are not calculated as your assets.","makersAndTakers":"Makers and Takers","makersAndTakersDes":"A maker order is a limit order that goes into the order book before being filled. For example, if the current BTC's lowest ask price is 1,000 USDT and you create a maker order with a bid price of 999 USDT, this order cannot be filled immediately. Then it will be entered into the order book until someone fills it in. Once filled, you're required to pay the maker fee and the taker will pay the taker fee. You need to pay the taker fee when your market ask order is traded successfully.","level":"User Level","vol":"30d Volume (USDT)","condition":"And / Or","balance":"Assets (USDT)","maker_rate":"Maker Fee Rate","taker_rate":"Taker Fee Rate","tradingFeeTier":"Trading fee tier","feesTitle":"BloFin Fee Schedule | Competitive Crypto Trading Fees | BloFin","feesDes":"Discover BloFin's competitive crypto trading fee schedule. Learn about our fee structure for BTC, ETH, and other digital assets. Benefit from low fees for futures and spot trading on our secure cryptocurrency exchange.","tradingVolue":"API Trading Volume ≤ 20%","generalTradingFee":"General Trading Fee","generalTradingFeeDes":"BloFin provides futures and spot trading, and the general trading fees for users are as follows.","markets":"Markets","timeLimitedDiscount":"Time-limited Discount","timeLimitedDiscountDes":"BloFin offers fee discounts on selected cryptocurrencies, with the details of these discounts as follows.","symbols":"Symbols","futuresDiscountSymbols":"Futures Discount Symbols","spotDiscountSymbols":"Spot Discount Symbols","expirationTime":"Expiration Time","vipFeeTier":"VIP Fee Tier","vipFeeTierDes1":"BloFin offers different trading fee rates for VIP users. Users can enjoy higher trading fee discounts according to their VIP levels.","vipFeeTierDes2":"Users can level up their VIP status to unlock corresponding fee discounts by increasing either their asset balance or trading volume over the past 30 days. VIP levels are updated daily at 1:00 (UTC). Sub-accounts will synchronize their fee rates with the main account. Please refer to the table below for the processing fees for different products and the requirements for each VIP level.","vipFeeTierDes3":"If users meet the conditions for different fee tiers in terms of total trading volume of perpetual contracts,  spot trading volume, and total assets, they will enjoy the fee discount of the highest fee tier.","vipFeeTierDes4":"For example, if a user’s 30-day total trading volume of perpetual contracts is 68,000,000 USDT (VIP 3) and their 30-day spot trading volume is 28,000,000 USDT (VIP 2), the user will enjoy fee discounts in all markets as a VIP 3 user.","tradingVolumeDes30D":"BloFin will calculate the total 30-day volume of all your futures trades and spot trades, and reset it at 00:00 (UTC) everyday.","totalAssetsDes1":"BloFin will take a snapshot of users' crypto assets at 00:00 (UTC) every day, covering the balance of the Funding Account and Trading Account, with Futures Bonus and Vouchers excluded.","makersAndTakersDes1":"A maker order is a limit order that goes into the order book before being filled. For example, if the current lowest ask price for BTC is 1,000 USDT and you create a maker order with a bid price of 999 USDT, this order will not be filled immediately. It will then enter the order book until someone fills it. Once filled, you are required to pay the maker fee, and the taker will pay the taker fee. You also need to pay the taker fee when your limit ask order is filled.","vip":"VIP","tiers":"Tiers","futuresTradingVolume30D":"30 days futures trading volume (USDT)","spotTradingVolume30D":"30 days spot trading volume (USDT)","symbolsWithHighRisk":"Symbols with high-risk","symbolsWithHighRiskDes":"These cryptocurrencies involve higher trading risks, and the details are as follows. Please exercise caution when participating.","futuresSymbols":"Futures Symbols","spotSymbols":"Spot Symbols","feesSEODes":"Compare BloFin’s competitive crypto trading fees for spot and futures, see tiered VIP discounts, maker/taker rates, and flexible pricing to help reduce costs.","discountAndRiskRates":"Discount \u0026 Risk Rates"},"account":{"nationality":"Country","firstName":"First and Middle Name","lastName":"Last Name","id":"ID Type","number":"ID Number","userId":"User ID","uid":"UID","regularUser":"Regular User","identification":"Identification","vip":"VIP","vipTrialTooltip":"You are currently on VIP {level} Trial from {start} to {end}","addNickname":"Add a nickname","cancel":"Cancel","confirm":"Confirm","updateUserNameError":"The name should contain 3 to 20 characters, letters and numbers only.","copySuccess":"Copied","error":"error","security":"Security","password":"Password","passwordSecondary":"Account login password.","email":"Email","emailSecondary":"Protect your account and transactions.","phoneNumber":"Phone Number","phone":"Phone","phoneSecondary":"Protect your account and transactions.","googleAuthenticator":"Google Authenticator","googleSecondary":"To better protect your account and transactions, please download and install Google Authenticator.","anti-Phishing":"Anti-Phishing Code","antiSecondary":"The anti-phishing code will appear in all official BloFin emails to prevent phishing attempts.","remove":"Remove","setup":"Set up","set":"Set","link":"Link","change":"Change","changePasswordMsg":"Password changed successfully","notMatch":"Passwords do not match","passwordRule":"8-32 characters, including at least 1 number, 1 uppercase letter, and 1 lowercase letter.","changePasswordTitle":"Change Login Password","setupPasswordTitle":"Set Login Password","setupPasswordMsg":"Password set successfully","setupConfirmPassword":"Confirm Password","oldPassword":"Old Password","oldPasswordRequire":"Please enter your current password","newPassword":"New Password","newPasswordRequire":"Please enter your new password","confirmPassword":"Confirm New Password","confirmPasswordRequire":"Please re-enter your new password","setupPhoneMsg":"Phone number set successfully